================================================================================
GNN+HRNet 全量训练日志 (q_l1_pwin)
================================================================================
日期: 2026-09-09
训练命令: ./auto_train.sh   (默认 80 epochs)

---- 模型结构 ----
  GNN  : GATv2, num_layers=3, hidden=128, heads=4, edge_dim=1, dropout=0.1
  场头 : HRNet, grid=64, base=64, stages=4, blocks_per_stage=2, expand_ratio=2
  条件 : FiLM (global_cond = mean+max 池化, dim=256)
  参数量: 7.32M

---- 损失 (q_l1_pwin) ----
  loss = MSE + 0.15*L1(Sobel梯度) + 0.20*L1(拉普拉斯) + 0.40*MSE(峰值3x3邻域)

---- 训练超参 ----
  epochs=80, batch_size=64, lr=5e-4, weight_decay=1e-4, grad_clip=1.0
  scheduler=CosineAnnealingLR(T_max=80), 衰减到 0
  数据: train=64000, val=8000 (总 80000, 8:1:1 按布局 i 划分, seed=0)
  num_workers=28, seed=0, hotspot_thr=0.05
  保存: 每 5 epoch 存 checkpoint_epXXX.pth; val RMSE 最优另存 best.pth
  输出目录: checkpoints/gnnhrnet_pwin

